#
# DIHEDRAL (proper): ghost-ghost springs, one ring group per real AMBER
# Fourier harmonic of each covered chi1-4 (family SIDECHAIN), phi (family PHI),
# psi (family PSI) and omega (family OMEGA) axis -- see
# doc/BondedForceFieldSprings.md. dc_offset
# (kJ.mol-1) is this spring's share of its axis's exact energy correction
# (ring construction artifact minus AMBER's own real DC, see
# calibrate_ring/emit_ghost_ring): BondedForceFieldReader sums it across
# every DIHEDRAL entry actually applied and subtracts the total only when
# *reporting* dihedral energy -- forces are unaffected (a constant has no
# gradient).
#    type     name                       resname family    atom_ref atom_rotant  d0_A       k        dc_offset
